WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.502
Come on, Arthur.
This is our time.

00:00:01.502 --> 00:00:05.005
♪ I feel glorious, glorious ♪

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:11.094
- We all know. Anything
can happen out there.

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:15.974
Sometimes we feel lost.
We push and we suffer.

00:00:16.892 --> 00:00:19.811
We keep going. That
makes all the difference.

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:22.856
Hey, what happened to you, boy?

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.275
You don't look so good.
Meatball?

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:26.944
Look, somebody likes
my meatballs.

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:27.778
- Hey, Paw Patrol.

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:29.321
We got a race to win.

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.531
- Just remember, Michael,

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:32.324
this race doesn't define you.

00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:35.452
- I raced for 19 years. This
is my last chance to win.

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:36.954
- 3, 2, 1.

00:00:36.954 --> 00:00:38.997
♪ I was a young
boy living in the city ♪

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:41.667
♪ All we do is
run, run, run, run, run ♪

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:42.835
- Over the next 10 days,

00:00:42.835 --> 00:00:45.712
these athletes
will cross 400 miles

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:47.381
climbing, biking, and kayaking.

00:00:47.381 --> 00:00:49.716
- That dot is Daddy.
- Go, Daddy dot.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.887
- That's the dog I gave
the meatballs to.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.556
Three days and 200 miles ago.

00:00:55.556 --> 00:00:57.391
- Leave the stupid dog
and let's go. Come on.

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:00.394
Move, you dumb dog.

00:01:00.394 --> 00:01:01.228
- What is it, boy?

00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:04.189
- Oh.
- Oh, God.

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:06.066
- Can't believe I almost
walked right off that cliff.

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.442
Extra meatballs for you,
my friend.

00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:10.696
He's hurting.

00:01:10.696 --> 00:01:12.197
What do you think he went
through before he met us?

00:01:13.115 --> 00:01:14.992
- Whatever it was,
it wasn't good.

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:17.703
- How the hell did he get
all the way from here to there?

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:19.496
While we were
on bikes and zip lines

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:20.956
and running and climbing?

00:01:21.707 --> 00:01:23.458
- He must have wings.
We don't know about.

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:24.293
- Good boy.

00:01:24.293 --> 00:01:27.588
♪ You know I'm back,
like I never left ♪

00:01:27.588 --> 00:01:29.965
- You wanna start
to embrace the buckets of pain.

00:01:29.965 --> 00:01:31.216
- I need a bigger bucket.

00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:34.219
- Team Broadrail has
traveled over 200 miles,

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:36.305
and they've found a companion.

00:01:36.305 --> 00:01:38.724
- Daddy has a dog.
- What have you done?

00:01:38.724 --> 00:01:40.726
- Think you found a new partner
in suffering, Michael.

00:01:40.726 --> 00:01:43.020
- Yeah, he's the king. I think
we should call him Arthur.

00:01:44.188 --> 00:01:45.397
Arthur the King.

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:47.900
- How's he doing?

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:49.067
- He's been through so much.

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:52.237
- This dog needs a vet.

00:01:52.237 --> 00:01:53.405
- I don't want you
to hurt anymore.

00:01:55.032 --> 00:01:55.991
He's a fighter.

00:01:57.159 --> 00:01:58.202
- Just like you.

00:01:58.202 --> 00:02:00.913
♪ I feel glorious ♪
- Ah, the famous dog.

00:02:00.913 --> 00:02:02.456
Looks even worse
than the rest of you.

00:02:02.456 --> 00:02:03.790
Maybe you all
deserve each other.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.417
- Always underestimated,
aren't we, buddy?

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.212
- This isn't the route
on the map.

00:02:08.212 --> 00:02:10.172
- It's okay.
Just follow Arthur.

00:02:10.172 --> 00:02:11.006
- Lead the way, King.

00:02:15.302 --> 00:02:16.428
- I've never seen
anything like this.

00:02:16.428 --> 00:02:17.804
- Everybody knows about him.

00:02:21.517 --> 00:02:23.519
Guess what?
I'm not a dog person.

00:02:23.519 --> 00:02:24.394
[dog whines]

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:25.979
♪ ♪

